<title>HUNGARY: C.EUROPE'S CESI JUMPS AS ALL THREE MARKETS FIRM.</title>
<headline>C.EUROPE'S CESI JUMPS AS ALL THREE MARKETS FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index surged on Monday to end at 1,505.87 points, up 8.61 points or 0.58 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
